Kurobayomi
Copyright the Kurobayomi contributors.

Kurobayomi is a Rust and GTK4 rewrite of Aniyomi, which is a fork of Mihon (formerly Tachiyomi).
It reimplements their behaviour from their public source code and keeps their licence terms.

Aniyomi   https://github.com/aniyomiorg/aniyomi   Apache License 2.0
Mihon     https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon        Apache License 2.0
Tachiyomi https://github.com/tachiyomiorg/tachiyomi Apache License 2.0

The full licence text is in LICENSE.
